{"id":"en_7000-dollars-destroyed-30-years-friendship","title":"7000 dollars destroyed 30 years friendship","titleEn":"7000 dollars destroyed 30 years friendship","description":"Robert shares his family’s bacon recipe to rescue his friend Frank’s struggling restaurant. The recipe proves hugely lucrative, generating $250,000 in annual profit, yet Robert receives only $7,000 for it. With his family’s backing, he opens his own shop directly across the street and reveals Frank’s greed to the public. Frank’s breach-of-contract fines drive him into bankruptcy, leaving him to sell on the street, while Robert’s restaurant thrives and he cuts all ties with the man who refused to show him gratitude.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/7000-dollars-destroyed-30-years-friendship/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/7000-dollars-destroyed-30-years-friendship/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Corporate Warfare","Rags to Riches","Urban Life","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dumb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_7000-dollars-destroyed-30-years-friendship_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dumb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_7000-dollars-destroyed-30-years-friendship_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dumb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_7000-dollars-destroyed-30-years-friendship_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dumb8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_7000-dollars-destroyed-30-year